{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A brand-new party game that mixes romance and deception!</strong><br>Confess your love and take down your opponents!<br>Enjoy thrilling mind games in this fully command-based online PvP experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Basic Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to <strong>successfully confess your feelings to other players</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your confession <strong>succeeds</strong>, the player you confessed to is <strong>eliminated</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it <strong>fails</strong>, you\u2019re the one who gets <strong>eliminated</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use confessions to eliminate all players on the opposing team and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses through alternating <strong>Day</strong> and <strong>Night Turns</strong>.<br>Each turn, players choose <strong>one command</strong> from a set of actions and execute it.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During <strong>Day Turns</strong>, you can raise another player's affection toward you, increasing your chance of a successful confession.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During <strong>Night Turns</strong>, you can confess and try to eliminate someone from the game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an <strong>online PvP game for 2 to 8 players</strong> only.<br>You cannot play alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Match</strong>: Get matched with random players who are online at the same time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Match</strong>: Play only with players who enter the same password as you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fresh New Way to Connect!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The theme is romance!</strong>\u00a0<br>Enjoy conversations and playful teasing you wouldn\u2019t normally have!<br>You might even discover your friends\u2019 secret views on love\u2026!?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984440?t=1757401171","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984440?t=1757401171","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984440/0b1d85ad1e7c3a9d54c2e993aee10bbcb9372884/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757401171","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984440/0b1d85ad1e7c3a9d54c2e993aee10bbcb9372884/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757401171","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A brand-new party game that mixes romance and deception!</strong><br>Confess your love and take down your opponents!<br>Enjoy thrilling mind games in this fully command-based online PvP experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Basic Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to <strong>successfully confess your feelings to other players</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your confession <strong>succeeds</strong>, the player you confessed to is <strong>eliminated</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it <strong>fails</strong>, you\u2019re the one who gets <strong>eliminated</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use confessions to eliminate all players on the opposing team and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses through alternating <strong>Day</strong> and <strong>Night Turns</strong>.<br>Each turn, players choose <strong>one command</strong> from a set of actions and execute it.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During <strong>Day Turns</strong>, you can raise another player's affection toward you, increasing your chance of a successful confession.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During <strong>Night Turns</strong>, you can confess and try to eliminate someone from the game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an <strong>online PvP game for 2 to 8 players</strong> only.<br>You cannot play alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Match</strong>: Get matched with random players who are online at the same time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Match</strong>: Play only with players who enter the same password as you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fresh New Way to Connect!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The theme is romance!</strong>\u00a0<br>Enjoy conversations and playful teasing you wouldn\u2019t normally have!<br>You might even discover your friends\u2019 secret views on love\u2026!?</p>","developers":["coeda"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984440/fa5e43c95ca1dba06c3e2fc435166e4c4af31b10/header.jpg?t=1757401171","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257194484,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194484/movie480.mp4?t=1757401168","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_